# LF everywhere, including in the working tree on Windows.
#
# This is not a style preference. `bundle.mjs` inlines css/styles.css and every
# JS module verbatim into vacation-guru.html, so the bundle's bytes depend on
# the line endings of its inputs. With the usual Windows checkout the same
# source would produce a different bundle on a developer's machine than in CI,
# and the "committed build output is up to date" check would fail forever
# without anything actually being wrong.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated. Diffs of a 2 MB single-file bundle or a 1 MB photo manifest help
# nobody; mark them so reviews stay readable.
vacation-guru.html   linguist-generated=true -diff
data/photos.json     linguist-generated=true -diff
data/fiction/photos.json linguist-generated=true -diff
data/destinations.json   linguist-generated=true -diff
data/fiction/destinations.json linguist-generated=true -diff
